<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<p><strong>Update 01.03.2025:</strong><br>After a decade of connecting yoga enthusiasts and professionals, <strong>we have made the difficult decision to close YogaTrail</strong> due to ongoing challenges to operate our business in a sustainable way. We are deeply grateful for your support and trust throughout this journey. YogaTrail will remain offline and we have no plans to restart the business in the future. For any questions or assistance, fell free to contact us via &#x69;n&#x66;o&#x40;&#121;&#x6f;&#103;a&#x74;r&#x61;&#105;&#x6c;&#46;&#x63;&#111;m. Thank you for being a part of our community.</p>



<p><strong>Looking for Alternatives?</strong><br>For Yoga Teachers and small Studios who are looking for a lightweight software solution to manage their business we recommend you check out&nbsp;<a href="http://ubindi.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Ubindi</a>&nbsp;&#8211; a great new project by YogaTrail&#8217;s Co-Founders Alex &amp; Alex.</p>


